    <briefdescription>
<para>A point-like graphical primitive. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classfccvis_1_1scene_1_1meta_1_1Marker" kindref="compound">Marker</ref> represents a single position in three-dimensional space together with its display color and size.</para>
<para>Markers can be used for annotations, reference points, detector features, or other point-like visualization elements. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
